WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.700
seems like a thousand years ago

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.100
I fought my way out of that cave

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:12.480
became Iron Man

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.240
realized I loved you

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.700
I know I said no more surprises, but...

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.260
...I was really hoping to pull off one last one.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.460
The world has changed

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.820
none of us can go back

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.380
all we can do is our best...

00:00:43.355 --> 00:00:45.635
...and sometimes the best that we can do...

00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:48.875
...is to start over.

00:01:01.235 --> 00:01:03.375
I saw all these people die

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.460
I keep telling everybody they should move on

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:13.380
some do...

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:15.080
...but not us.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:20.920
even if there's a small chance

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:24.400
we owe this

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:27.440
to everyone who is not in this room... to try.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:32.660
we will

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:35.740
whatever it takes

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.200
whatever it takes

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:43.540
whatever it takes

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.040
whatever it takes

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.880
I like this one

